            <p>
               <lb/>
               <pb ed="TBOO" n="VI.365"/>Dvm tempvs habemur operemur
          <app>
                  <lem resp="#Vellev">bonum</lem>
                  <rdg>om.  TBOO</rdg>
               </app>
            </p>
            <p>Hoc Vallvm et Molam papyraceam
        cvm omnibvs adivnctis artificiis et svperivs dispositis piscinis
        hic vbi nihil tale <app>
                  <lem resp="#Vellev">antea</lem>
                  <rdg resp="#TBOO">ante</rdg>
               </app> extitit in patriæ svvm
        posterorvmqve commodvm ordinatione labore et svmptibvs propriis</p>
            <closer>
               <signed>Tycho Brahe O. de Knvdstrvp <lb/>ff</signed>
               <dateline>incepit anno 1590 complevit 1592</dateline>
